    question: "Why does Servana use roles and permissions?",
    answer: "Servana handles sensitive operational areas such as client records, invoices, payments, commissions, platform fees, branch access, and audit logs.\n\nRoles and permissions help each user see and do only what is appropriate for their responsibilities.",
